    lt:stepFreeAccessNote "Baker Street ?(Jubilee line only) You can change between southbound Metropolitan line platform 3 and terminus Metropolitan line platform 4 r. You can change between the terminus Metropolitan line platform 1 and Metropolitan northbound platform 2 r. From both of these platforms there is a step-free route to eastbound Hammersmith & City line platform 5 M. You can change between the Bakerloo line southbound r and the Jubilee line southbound A. You can also change between the Bakerloo line northbound r and the Jubilee line northbound A. There is no Help Point on the southbound Bakerloo line platform. Please notify a member of staff at your origin station if you would like to interchange at Baker Street." ;
    lt:stopName "Baker Street Underground Station" ;
    dcterms:source "https://api.tfl.gov.uk/StopPoint/940GZZLUBST" .

